# Impeccable: a third-party design skill pack, vendored per-developer rather
# than committed. ~2 MB of playbooks plus a launcher that caches a downloaded
# engine binary — none of it ours, and none of it needed to build or run the
# app. Reinstall from github.com/pbakaus/impeccable.
# What it *produces* (DESIGN.md, PRODUCT.md) is ours and does get committed.
.claude/skills/impeccable/
.impeccable/config.local.json
